<title>USA: Hawaiian Airlines November load factor.</title>
<headline>Hawaiian Airlines November load factor.</headline>
<dateline>HONOLULU 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hawaiian Airlines said its November load factor fell 3.5 points to 75.1 percent.</p>
<p>It also said November revenue passenger miles fell six percent to 297,722,000 and available seat miles fell six percent to 316,827,000.</p>
<p>The airline said it carried 406,818 passengers in November 1996, down 4.1 percent from 424,314 in November.</p>
